  "ingredients": [
    "3 tablespoon avocado oil (divided)",
    "1/4 medium yellow onion (sliced)",
    "1 teaspoon fresh garlic (minced)",
    "8 ounce cauliflower (riced)",
    "4 ounce kale (chopped)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "2 tablespoon fresh parsley (chopped)",
    "4 large egg"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Measure out and prepare all of the ingredients.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a frying pan over medium heat, add half of the avocado oil and sliced onion. Cook until the onion becomes translucent (about 3 - 4 minutes). Add in the minced garlic.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove stalks from kale and discard. Chop the leaves.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add the riced cauliflower along with the kale leaves into the frying pan.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir and cover with lid for about 5 minutes while cooking, then remove the lid and cook for 5 more minutes. Season with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using the other half of the avocado oil, add that into a separate frying pan. Crack the eggs and cook them sunny side up.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slide the eggs on top of the kale and cauliflower.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Keto-Easy-Eggs-Veggie-Bowl-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season with parsley. Serve immediately and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-easy-eggs-veggie-bowl/#wprm-recipe-54323-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
